const com_endpoint_google_thinking_budget$f = 'Guides the number of thinking tokens the model uses. The actual amount may exceed or fall below this value depending on the prompt.\n\nThis setting only applies to Gemini 2.5 and older models. For Gemini 3 and later, use the Thinking Level setting instead.\n\nGemini 2.5 Pro supports 128-32,768 tokens. Gemini 2.5 Flash supports 0-24,576 tokens. Gemini 2.5 Flash Lite supports 512-24,576 tokens.\n\nLeave blank or set to "-1" to let the model automatically decide when and how much to think. By default, Gemini 2.5 Flash Lite does not think.';
